# Copy to .env.local to point the app at another HarvestNet API.
# Leave unset when the gateway serves this app: it then calls /api on its own origin.
# For development, the core on this machine (set HARVESTNET_ALLOWED_ORIGIN on the core to this
# app's origin) or the example API skeleton, which returns the contract's example responses:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8050
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://5ibpa6ukufm2dmyidprwzv5e7e0vrpfj.lambda-url.us-east-2.on.aws
# Staff tokens are never set here. Staff type their organization's token into the app at runtime.
